script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAceBlack
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"정말, 얼굴에 알람 시계를 들이대고\n깨우는 것도 최악이라고\n생각했는데, 이보다 더한 방법이"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"있을 줄이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
