	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAceBlack
	"신세를 졌군."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"...뭐, 늘 신세 지고 있지\n않나? 하하."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"천만에..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"친구라면 누구나 할 일을\n했을 뿐이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제 우리 둘이 함께 딜러와\n싸울 수 있겠네, 그렇지!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAceBlack
	"그렇고말고."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"멋진데!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그럼 우리..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
