script 5 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"꼬맹이!?\n야, 꼬맹이!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAceBlack
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	screenShake
		intensity = 4
		duration = 30
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이 자식!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아직 원래대로 돌아온 게\n아니구나!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 6 mmsf3 {
	bgmPlay
		bgm = 33
		fadeTime = 2
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAceBlack
	"이 말을 스바루에게 전해 줘."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너는 나보다 강하고,\n세상 누구보다\n강하다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그러니..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제부터 네가 지구를\n지켜라."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"에이스!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = AcidAceBlack
	"네 아이들이 자라날 세상이\n평화롭고 행복하도록\n잘 지켜 줘."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 7 mmsf3 {
